  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidation Program for Subnational Fiscal Responsibility II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Consolidacin de la Responsabilidad Fiscal Territorial II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa es contribuir a la estabilidad fiscal de Colombia mediante el aumento de la recaudacin local, un control ms efectivo de las finanzas de las entidades descentralizadas y una mejora de la calidad y oportunidad de las estadsticas fiscales territoriales.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program&apos;s main objective is to contribute to fiscal stability in Colombia through the increase of local tax collection, a more effective control of the public finances of decentralized entities and the improvement in the quality and timeliness of sub-national fiscal statistics.</narrative>
  </description>
